Hi,

OpenVPN offers the possibility to push "Windows-specific network  
settings" from the server to the client. Pushing a DNS server to the  
client doesn't seem to be Windows specific and would be quite a nice  
feature for other operating systems as well. I'd like to ask if it's  
intended that this is Windows only? I ask because I'd like to work on  
adding support for this under Mac OS X if you give me a starting  
point for implementing this kind of platform specific behavior.

Regards,
Ralf

